    <rigor>STANDARD</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Mechanical modify-only re-base of an existing dialog across 3 copies; no new surface, no retirement/deletion, `embedded` behavior preserved. STANDARD per author assignment — task-execute may auto-escalate to FULL given the `.tsx` edits (§8), which is acceptable.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
